Skeleton3D: keep the pose backup between updates instead of allocating it each time.

A skeleton with modifiers backed up every bone's pose into a local vector at each
update, allocating and freeing it every frame. The vectors are now members, which
keep their capacity.

Upstream: the bones_backup half is in godotengine/godot#113441 ("Optimize
Skeleton3D", open). Drop when that, or an equivalent, is in the Godot we pin.

diff --git a/scene/3d/skeleton_3d.cpp b/scene/3d/skeleton_3d.cpp
